WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.202
Take your maps with you. Save an atlas plate and export editable vector artwork.

2
00:00:03.202 --> 00:00:09.775
Open Map layers → Atlas plates to browse your finished sheets.

3
00:00:09.775 --> 00:00:14.456
Choose Illustrated world to view the complete atlas plate.

4
00:00:14.456 --> 00:00:20.361
Open Download, then save the Original PNG.

5
00:00:20.361 --> 00:00:26.406
Open Export on the bottom dock for other file formats.

6
00:00:26.406 --> 00:00:32.431
Choose Vector map, quick to download editable SVG artwork.

7
00:00:32.431 --> 00:00:36.400
Keep the PNG as a finished image; edit the SVG in a vector editor.
